			"notes": "## RandomSpawnPlus 1.1.0\n\nRandom spawn plugin for Paper/Spigot/Leaf (1.16+).\n\n### Features\n- Random surface spawn on first join within the world border\n- Random respawn on death without bed/anchor\n- Custom gamerule respawn_radius (alias randomSpawnRadius), stored per world in spawnzones.yml\n- Safe spot search (no water, lava, cacti, magma, fire, sweet berry bushes)\n\n### Config\n- border-margin, search-attempts, safe-search-radius, worlds (empty = all worlds)"
